  "paragraph": 14,
  "text": "Third come prompts—reusable workflow templates packaged right inside an MCP server. Unlike tools or resources, prompts are user-controlled. They show up in your AI app like handy slash commands—such as slash prep meeting, slash weekly brief, or slash review PR—so you can intentionally trigger a consistent, well-tested workflow with a single click instead of retyping long instructions.",
